IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DISPATCHER.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-STATUS                PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CURRENT-PROGRAM       PIC X(30).
01 WS-CURRENT-METHOD        PIC X(30).
01 WS-CURRENT-ARG-COUNT     PIC 9.
01 WS-ARGS OCCURS 10 INDEXED BY IDX.
   05 WS-ARG-VALUE          PIC X(100).

* Table des programmes et méthodes
01 PROGRAM-TABLE.
   05 PROGRAM-ENTRY OCCURS 5 INDEXED BY PROG-IDX.
      10 PROGRAM-NAME       PIC X(30).
      10 METHOD-TABLE OCCURS 5 INDEXED BY METH-IDX.
         15 METHOD-NAME     PIC X(30).
         15 METHOD-REF      PIC X(30).  *> Nom de la section COBOL.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 PROGRAM-NAME             PIC X(30).
01 METHOD-NAME              PIC X(30).
01 ARG-COUNT                PIC 9.
01 ARGS.
   05 ARGUMENT OCCURS 10 INDEXED BY IDX.
      10 ARG-VALUE          PIC X(100).
01 STATUS                   PIC 9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY REFERENCE PROGRAM-NAME METHOD-NAME
                           BY REFERENCE ARG-COUNT ARGS STATUS.

    *> Initialisation de la table de programmes/méthodes
    PERFORM INIT-PROGRAM-TABLE.

    *> Résolution du programme et méthode
    MOVE 0 TO STATUS.
    MOVE PROGRAM-NAME TO WS-CURRENT-PROGRAM.
    MOVE METHOD-NAME TO WS-CURRENT-METHOD.
    MOVE ARG-COUNT TO WS-CURRENT-ARG-COUNT.

    PERFORM RESOLVE-METHOD THRU RESOLVE-METHOD-EXIT
       UNTIL STATUS NOT = 0.

    IF STATUS = 0 THEN
       DISPLAY "Appel de : " WS-CURRENT-PROGRAM "->" WS-CURRENT-METHOD
       PERFORM DYNAMIC-CALL
    ELSE
       DISPLAY "Erreur : méthode non trouvée.".
    END-IF.

    EXIT PROGRAM.

INIT-PROGRAM-TABLE SECTION.
    MOVE "MYPROGRAM" TO PROGRAM-NAME(PROG-IDX).
    MOVE "MYFUNCTION" TO METHOD-NAME(PROG-IDX METH-IDX).
    MOVE "MYFUNCTION-CALL" TO METHOD-REF(PROG-IDX METH-IDX).
    EXIT.

RESOLVE-METHOD SECTION.
    SET PROG-IDX TO 1.
    SET METH-IDX TO 1.

    PERFORM VARYING PROG-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL PROG-IDX > 5
       IF PROGRAM-NAME(PROG-IDX) = WS-CURRENT-PROGRAM THEN
          PERFORM VARYING METH-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL METH-IDX > 5
             IF METHOD-NAME(PROG-IDX METH-IDX) = WS-CURRENT-METHOD THEN
                MOVE METHOD-REF(PROG-IDX METH-IDX) TO WS-CURRENT-METHOD
                EXIT PERFORM
             END-IF
          END-PERFORM
       END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

    IF WS-CURRENT-METHOD = SPACES THEN
       MOVE 1 TO STATUS
    END-IF.
RESOLVE-METHOD-EXIT.
    EXIT.

DYNAMIC-CALL SECTION.
    PERFORM WS-CURRENT-METHOD THRU WS-CURRENT-METHOD-EXIT.
    EXIT.

MYFUNCTION-CALL SECTION.
    DISPLAY "Appel dynamique : MYFUNCTION avec arguments : ".
    PERFORM VARYING IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IDX > WS-CURRENT-ARG-COUNT
       DISPLAY "Argument " IDX ": " ARG-VALUE(IDX).
    END-PERFORM.
MYFUNCTION-CALL-EXIT.
    EXIT.
